                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Great little time killer.\n\nThe aim is to dig and dig until you find the 'missing' gem: finding the gem completes the level and you move onto the next level which seems to constitue a deeper mine.\n\nBe warned you have limited energy and ladders (which you use to get to the surface) - these are refreshed by making contact with your 'base', being a UFO. You can upgrade ladders, power and your drill etc by making money from mining coal (the brown blocks with black specks)\n\nIt's fun - and cheap.\n\nenjoy.",
